<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-100.1-legal-matter-case-outside-counsel-management" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3257" name="W3257. Legal Matter Intake, Triage &amp; Matter Master" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Demand letter / summons received; dispute escalated by business unit; regulatory inquiry
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~50–150 new matters/year
Owner: Legal Operations Manager
Participants: Legal Ops Mgr, VP Legal &amp; Compliance, In-House Counsel, Business Owner, Records (links to VS-88)
Source: workflow W3257 — Legal Matter Intake, Triage &amp; Matter Master</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3257_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3257_Lane1" name="Legal Ops Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3257_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3257_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3257_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3257_Lane2" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3257_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3257_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3257_Start4" name="Demand letter / summons received; dispute escalated by business unit; regulatory inquiry">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3257_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3257_Task5" name="Legal Ops Mgr logs the intake of the matter: capture source (summons, demand…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal Ops Mgr logs the intake of the matter: capture source (summons, demand letter, business escalation, regulatory notice — links to VS-22), parties, subject matter, jurisdiction/venue, amount in controversy, key dates (answer deadline, hearing), originating business unit and documents; create unique matter ID in legal matter-management system
Responsible (R): Legal Ops Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per matter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3257_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3257_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3257_Task6" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance/In-House Counsel triage: assess merits, exposure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: VP Legal &amp; Compliance/In-House Counsel triage: assess merits, exposure, urgency, and complexity; assign handling (in-house vs outside counsel W3259), strategy (defend/settle/counterclaim/ADR W3260), and resourcing; classify by matter type (commercial, labor per VS-84, consumer/DTI per VS-13, property per VS-97, tax per VS-79, IP per PA-100.2); set reserves (W3261)
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / In-House Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per matter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3257_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3257_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3257_Task7" name="Open matter file and notify stakeholders: matter master (parties, counsel…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Open matter file and notify stakeholders: matter master (parties, counsel, dates, status, exposure, reserve), conflicts check (VS-100.3/W3275 conflict-of-interest also links to VS-86.3), litigation hold if applicable (W3262), business-owner briefing and document-collection request; integrate to risk register (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Legal Ops Mgr / In-House Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per matter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3257_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3257_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3257_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3257_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3257_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-529 (ensure controlled execution — Legal Matter, Case &amp; Outside Counsel Management (PA-100.1).) | - operational: docket/calendar discipline and triage SLA; operational: conflicts check (W3275)
Owner: Legal Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3257_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3257_Annotation9" targetRef="W3257_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3257_Flow11" sourceRef="W3257_Start4" targetRef="W3257_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3257_Flow12" sourceRef="W3257_Task5" targetRef="W3257_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3257_Flow13" sourceRef="W3257_Task6" targetRef="W3257_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3257_Flow14" sourceRef="W3257_Task7" targetRef="W3257_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3257_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3257_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3257">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3257_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3257_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3257_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W3257_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3257_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W3257_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3257_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W3257_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3257_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W3257_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3257_Start4_di" bpmnElement="W3257_Start4"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3257_End8_di" bpmnElement="W3257_End8"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="317" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3257_Annotation9_di" bpmnElement="W3257_Annotation9"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="460" width="360" height="72" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3257_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W3257_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3257_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W3257_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3257_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W3257_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="790" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3257_Flow14_di" bpmnElement="W3257_Flow14"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3257_Assoc10_di" bpmnElement="W3257_Assoc10"><di:waypoint x="340" y="460" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3258" name="W3258. Litigation Case Lifecycle &amp; Pre-Trial Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Active litigation matter
Frequency: Per case
Volume: ~30–80 active litigation cases
Owner: Litigation Counsel
Participants: Litigation Counsel, VP Legal &amp; Compliance, Outside Counsel (W3259), Business Owner, Records (links to VS-88)
Source: workflow W3258 — Litigation Case Lifecycle &amp; Pre-Trial Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3258_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3258_Lane1" name="Litigation Counsel">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3258_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3258_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3258_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3258_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3258_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3258_Start3" name="Active litigation matter">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3258_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3258_Task4" name="Manage answer/response and pleadings: prepare and file…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Manage answer/response and pleadings: prepare and file answer/counterclaim/third-party complaint within deadline, motions to dismiss, motions for bill of particulars; coordinate with business owner on facts and defenses; track all filings and court dates in docket
Responsible (R): Litigation Counsel / Outside Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3258_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3258_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3258_Task5" name="Manage discovery: written discovery (requests for admission, interrogatories…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manage discovery: written discovery (requests for admission, interrogatories, requests for documents), depositions, pre-trial conference and pre-trial order; coordinate evidence and witnesses (W3262), e-discovery with records (links to VS-88 W2990); manage privilege review and protective orders
Responsible (R): Litigation Counsel / Outside Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3258_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3258_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3258_Task6" name="Trial preparation and conduct: trial strategy, witness preparation, exhibit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Trial preparation and conduct: trial strategy, witness preparation, exhibit management, trial brief; attend hearings/trial; manage settlement opportunities throughout (W3261); update matter status, reserve, and stakeholders
Responsible (R): Litigation Counsel / Outside Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3258_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3258_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3258_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3258_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3258_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-529 (ensure controlled execution — Legal Matter, Case &amp; Outside Counsel Management (PA-100.1).) | - operational: early merits assessment and settlement discipline (W3261); operational: hold (W3262) and records coordination (links to VS-88)
Owner: Litigation Counsel</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3258_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3258_Annotation8" targetRef="W3258_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3258_Flow10" sourceRef="W3258_Start3" targetRef="W3258_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3258_Flow11" sourceRef="W3258_Task4" targetRef="W3258_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3258_Flow12" sourceRef="W3258_Task5" targetRef="W3258_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3258_Flow13" sourceRef="W3258_Task6" targetRef="W3258_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3258_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3258_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3258">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3258_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3258_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3258_Task4_di" bpmnElement="W3258_Task4"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3258_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W3258_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3258_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W3258_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3258_Start3_di" bpmnElement="W3258_Start3"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3258_End7_di" bpmnElement="W3258_End7"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3258_Annotation8_di" bpmnElement="W3258_Annotation8"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="290" width="360" height="86" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3258_Flow10_di" bpmnElement="W3258_Flow10"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3258_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W3258_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3258_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W3258_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="790" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3258_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W3258_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3258_Assoc9_di" bpmnElement="W3258_Assoc9"><di:waypoint x="340" y="290" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3259" name="W3259. Outside Counsel Selection, Engagement &amp; Billing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Matter requires external counsel (complexity, capacity, specialized expertise, jurisdiction)
Frequency: Per engagement
Volume: ~10–30 active outside-counsel engagements
Owner: Legal Operations Manager
Participants: Legal Ops Mgr, VP Legal &amp; Compliance, Procurement (links to VS-34), Finance, Outside Counsel
Source: workflow W3259 — Outside Counsel Selection, Engagement &amp; Billing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3259_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3259_Lane1" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3259_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3259_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3259_Lane2" name="Legal Ops Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3259_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3259_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3259_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3259_Start4" name="Matter requires external counsel (complexity, capacity, specialized expertise…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3259_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3259_Task5" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance/Procurement (links to VS-34) select outside counsel…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Legal &amp; Compliance/Procurement (links to VS-34) select outside counsel: identify qualified firms (expertise, jurisdiction, track record), run conflicts check (W3275), request fee proposals; evaluate on expertise, cost, and fit; select per authority matrix; consider panel/preferred-firm strategy for recurring matter types
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Procurement / Legal Ops Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per engagement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3259_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3259_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3259_Task6" name="Legal/Finance negotiate engagement letter: scope, fee structure (hourly with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Finance negotiate engagement letter: scope, fee structure (hourly with rate caps, fixed/flat fee, contingency, blended), budget, staffing, conflict and ethical walls, document-handling/privilege, billing guidelines, termination; execute engagement letter and matter budget
Responsible (R): Legal Ops Mgr / Finance / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per engagement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3259_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3259_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3259_Task7" name="Manage outside counsel performance and billing: review and approve invoices…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage outside counsel performance and billing: review and approve invoices against engagement terms and budget (e-billing W3279), challenge excessive/unsupported entries, track spend vs budget and estimate-to-complete, manage counsel performance (responsiveness, quality); periodic review of panel
Responsible (R): Legal Ops Mgr / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per invoice/cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3259_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3259_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3259_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3259_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3259_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-529 (ensure controlled execution — Legal Matter, Case &amp; Outside Counsel Management (PA-100.1).) | - operational: budgets, billing guidelines, and e-billing controls; operational: panel management and performance review
Owner: Legal Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3259_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3259_Annotation9" targetRef="W3259_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3259_Flow11" sourceRef="W3259_Start4" targetRef="W3259_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3259_Flow12" sourceRef="W3259_Task5" targetRef="W3259_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3259_Flow13" sourceRef="W3259_Task6" targetRef="W3259_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3259_Flow14" sourceRef="W3259_Task7" targetRef="W3259_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3259_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3259_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3259">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3259_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3259_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3259_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W3259_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3259_Task5_di" bpmnElement="W3259_Task5"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3259_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W3259_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3259_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W3259_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3259_Start4_di" bpmnElement="W3259_Start4"><dc:Bounds x="290" y="147" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3259_End8_di" bpmnElement="W3259_End8"><dc:Bounds x="1050" y="317" width="36" height="36" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3259_Annotation9_di" bpmnElement="W3259_Annotation9"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="460" width="360" height="72" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3259_Flow11_di" bpmnElement="W3259_Flow11"><di:waypoint x="326" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="400" y="165" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3259_Flow12_di" bpmnElement="W3259_Flow12"><di:waypoint x="580" y="165" /><di:waypoint x="610" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3259_Flow13_di" bpmnElement="W3259_Flow13"><di:waypoint x="790" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="820" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3259_Flow14_di" bpmnElement="W3259_Flow14"><di:waypoint x="1000" y="335" /><di:waypoint x="1050" y="335" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
        <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="W3259_Assoc10_di" bpmnElement="W3259_Assoc10"><di:waypoint x="340" y="460" /><di:waypoint x="308" y="183" /></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3260" name="W3260. Alternative Dispute Resolution, Arbitration &amp; Mediation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: ADR clause in contract; strategic settlement opportunity; court-annexed mediation
Frequency: Per matter
Volume: ~20–60 ADR events/year
Owner: Litigation Counsel
Participants: Litigation Counsel, VP Legal &amp; Compliance, Business Owner, Mediator/Arbitrator, Counterparty
Source: workflow W3260 — Alternative Dispute Resolution, Arbitration &amp; Mediation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3260_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3260_Lane1" name="Litigation Counsel">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3260_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3260_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3260_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3260_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3260_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3260_Start3" name="ADR clause in contract; strategic settlement opportunity; court-annexed mediation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3260_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3260_Task4" name="Assess ADR suitability: evaluate contractual ADR clauses (arbitration — CIAC…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Assess ADR suitability: evaluate contractual ADR clauses (arbitration — CIAC for construction, commercial arbitration per the Arbitration Law (RA 876) and the ADR Act (RA 9285); mediation), cost/time/precedence vs litigation, confidentiality benefit, relationship preservation; recommend ADR where advantageous
Responsible (R): Litigation Counsel / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per matter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3260_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3260_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3260_Task5" name="Conduct ADR: select mediator/arbitrator and institution, prepare position and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Conduct ADR: select mediator/arbitrator and institution, prepare position and settlement range (W3261), attend sessions, negotiate; for arbitration, present case and manage award; document proceedings and outcomes under privilege
Responsible (R): Litigation Counsel / Outside Counsel / Business Owner
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per ADR</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3260_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3260_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3260_Task6" name="Conclude: execute settlement agreement (W3261) or manage arbitral award…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Conclude: execute settlement agreement (W3261) or manage arbitral award (confirmation/vacatur/enforcement per W3263); close matter and update records; capture lessons and update contract templates (W3273) and dispute strategy
Responsible (R): Litigation Counsel / Legal Ops Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per ADR</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3260_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3260_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3260_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3260_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
