        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-529 (ensure controlled execution — Legal Matter, Case &amp; Outside Counsel Management (PA-100.1).) | - operational: realistic assessment and settlement discipline; operational: sound procedure and enforcement (W3263)
Owner: Litigation Counsel</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
