    <bpmn:process id="W_W3261" name="W3261. Settlement, Judgment &amp; Loss Accrual Accounting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Settlement negotiation; judgment; probable loss
Frequency: Per matter + period-end
Volume: ~20–50 settlements/judgments/year
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Participants: VP Legal &amp; Compliance, Finance (links to VS-17), Litigation Counsel, Tax (links to VS-79), Treasury (links to VS-18)
Source: workflow W3261 — Settlement, Judgment &amp; Loss Accrual Accounting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3261_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3261_Lane1" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3261_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3261_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3261_Lane2" name="Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3261_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3261_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3261_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3261_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3261_Start5" name="Settlement negotiation; judgment; probable loss">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3261_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3261_Task6" name="Establish settlement authority and range: VP Legal &amp; Compliance and Finance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Establish settlement authority and range: VP Legal &amp; Compliance and Finance assess exposure, probable outcome, settlement value vs litigation cost/risk; obtain settlement authority per authority matrix (links to VS-36); negotiate within authority; for judgments, analyze appeal prospects
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Finance / Litigation Counsel
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per matter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3261_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3261_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3261_Task7" name="Finance assess and accrue loss contingency per PFRS/IAS 37: probable outflow…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance assess and accrue loss contingency per PFRS/IAS 37: probable outflow and reliable estimate → accrue and disclose; possible → disclose only; remote → no action; update reserve as facts develop; coordinate with audit (links to VS-22.2) and consolidation (links to VS-17.2)
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3261_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3261_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3261_Task8" name="Execute and account: settlement agreement and release, payment (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Execute and account: settlement agreement and release, payment (links to VS-15/VS-18), tax treatment (deductibility, DST on settlement documents, links to VS-79), derecognize reserve and book gain/loss on settlement; close matter (W3257) and update analytics (W3264)
Responsible (R): Finance / Legal Ops Mgr / Tax
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per settlement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3261_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3261_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3261_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3261_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3261_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-154 (ensure legal matter &amp; IP portfolio control.) | - operational: PAS 37 (IAS 37) discipline and legal-finance coordination; operational: merits assessment and authority discipline
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
