    <bpmn:process id="W_W3263" name="W3263. Court Filing, Service &amp; Judgment Enforcement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Pleadings/motions to file; judgment to enforce; service required
Frequency: Per case event
Volume: Hundreds of filings/year across active cases
Owner: Litigation Counsel
Participants: Litigation Counsel, Legal Ops Mgr, Outside Counsel, Process Server, Sheriff
Source: workflow W3263 — Court Filing, Service &amp; Judgment Enforcement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3263_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3263_Lane1" name="Litigation Counsel">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3263_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3263_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3263_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3263_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3263_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3263_Start3" name="Pleadings/motions to file; judgment to enforce; service required">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3263_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3263_Task4" name="Manage court filings and service: prepare and file pleadings/motions with the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Manage court filings and service: prepare and file pleadings/motions with the correct court (RTC, MTC, MTCC, NLRC, CA, SC, quasi-judicial bodies), pay docket/filing fees (links to VS-15), serve process on parties per Rules of Court; track filings and service proofs
Responsible (R): Litigation Counsel / Outside Counsel / Process Server
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per filing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3263_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3263_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3263_Task5" name="Enforce favorable judgments: secure writ of execution, coordinate sheriff for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Enforce favorable judgments: secure writ of execution, coordinate sheriff for levy/garnishment/attachment on counterparty assets, record judgment liens, pursue garnishment of bank accounts/receivables; manage post-judgment collection (links to VS-16.2)
Responsible (R): Litigation Counsel / Outside Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per judgment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3263_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3263_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3263_Task6" name="Manage appeals: assess appeal prospects and deadlines (notice of appeal, record…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage appeals: assess appeal prospects and deadlines (notice of appeal, record on appeal), brief and file appeal; manage counterparty appeals (supersedeas bond to stay execution); track through appellate levels
Responsible (R): Litigation Counsel / Outside Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per appeal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3263_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3263_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3263_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3263_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
