    <bpmn:process id="W_W3264" name="W3264. Legal Matter Analytics &amp; Loss Forecasting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly legal review; period-end reserve cycle; board reporting
Frequency: Quarterly + period-end
Volume: Portfolio of matters
Owner: Legal Operations Manager
Participants: Legal Ops Mgr, VP Legal &amp; Compliance, Finance (links to VS-17), Risk (links to VS-21.2), Board (links to VS-36.1)
Source: workflow W3264 — Legal Matter Analytics &amp; Loss Forecasting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3264_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3264_Lane1" name="Legal Ops Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3264_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3264_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3264_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3264_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3264_Lane3" name="VP Legal &amp; Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3264_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3264_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3264_Start5" name="Quarterly legal review; period-end reserve cycle; board reporting">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3264_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3264_Task6" name="Legal Ops Mgr/Finance compile matter portfolio analytics: matters by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal Ops Mgr/Finance compile matter portfolio analytics: matters by type/stage/exposure/counsel, aging, reserve roll-forward, spend vs budget, win/loss/settlement outcomes, cycle time, outside-counsel spend
Responsible (R): Legal Ops Mgr / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3264_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3264_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3264_Task7" name="Finance/VP Legal &amp; Compliance forecast legal loss: aggregate probable/possible…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance/VP Legal &amp; Compliance forecast legal loss: aggregate probable/possible exposures, model expected loss, set/adjust reserves (W3261), stress-test for tail risks; reconcile to financial statements and audit (links to VS-22.2/VS-17.2)
Responsible (R): Finance / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Period-end</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3264_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3264_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3264_Task8" name="Report to executive committee and board (links to VS-36.1 litigation update)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Report to executive committee and board (links to VS-36.1 litigation update): portfolio summary, key matters, trends, loss forecast, risk-register updates (links to VS-21.2), recommendations (prevention, contract improvement W3273, insurance coverage/recovery W59); drive preventive action
Responsible (R): VP Legal &amp; Compliance / Legal Ops Mgr
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3264_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3264_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3264_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3264_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3264_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-529 (ensure controlled execution — Legal Matter, Case &amp; Outside Counsel Management (PA-100.1).) | - operational: analytics and PAS 37 (IAS 37) discipline; operational: prevention analytics and contract/policy improvement
Owner: Legal Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
